  "text": "Notary won't touch money until it has proven how its tools behave. It turns every promise in the docs into a claim, commits a hashed prediction before each test call, then calls the API and compares. A Reflector proposes explanations, and a stronger Adversary tries to refute them. In our runs, it narrowed all five beliefs. What survives becomes a certificate. No certificate, no money moves: the Guard holds anything uncovered for a person to review.",
